    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Quillsen are delighted to bring to the market this bright, nicely presented, 2 bedroom top floor apartment. It is situated within The Northumberlands, which is a highly acclaimed and popular Cosgrave built development, located off Lower Mount Street and just minutes walk from the city centre. The development is secure, gated and well-managed with an on-site caretaker.This apartment is perfect for those seeking out their first home, an investment or for family going to college.\n\nBoasting an abundance of natural light throughout, the apartment has been maintained to a high standard. A particular feature of No 139 is the sunny south facing rear balcony.The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, a bright living/dining room with patio doors leading to the sunny balcony.There is a separate kitchen, two double bedrooms and a bathroom. The apartment is further complemented with a secure underground designated car parking space, an internal residents` courtyard garden and a communal roof terrace. \n\nThe apartment is situated in a prime location between the Grand Canal and Merrion Square just minutes walk from Ballsbridge, Grafton Street and Grand Canal Dock. Trinity College and the Royal College of Surgeons are a short walk away. The City centre is on your doorstep with an abundance of amenities nearby including restaurants, bars, the Aviva Stadium, The National Gallery, The Concert Hall and the Bord GaisTheatre.\n\nAn early viewing is recommended.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3m (9'10\") x 2m (6'7\")\nStorage cupboard\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 5.5m (18'1\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\nAttractive wood flooring, ceiling coving and feature fireplace. Double glazed patio doors to south facing balcony.\n\nKitchen - 1.8m (5'11\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\nWall and floor units, stainless steel sink unit, Beko hob & oven. Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher..Fridge Freezer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m (12'2\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\nBuilt-in wardrobes. Attractive floorboards.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m (10'6\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nBuilt-in wardrobes. Attractive floorboards.\n\nBathroom - 1.7m (5'7\") x 2m (6'7\")\nBath with electricTriton shower, pedestal whb & wc. Attractive wall and floor tiling.\nAiring cupboard.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
